{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371170/extras/df7c110ff9656b2696db9df1ade0ed21.poster.avif?t=1760010700\" width=670 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371170/extras/df7c110ff9656b2696db9df1ade0ed21.webm?t=1760010700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371170/extras/df7c110ff9656b2696db9df1ade0ed21.mp4?t=1760010700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARK</strong> is a chess-inspired roguelike on a <strong>5\u00d75</strong> board. Play <strong>piece-cards</strong> to move your King, draft \u201cfood\u201d modifiers. Short runs, high skill ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371170/extras/942ef34b173b5b306b2796b20888c9d0.poster.avif?t=1760010700\" width=704 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371170/extras/942ef34b173b5b306b2796b20888c9d0.webm?t=1760010700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371170/extras/942ef34b173b5b306b2796b20888c9d0.mp4?t=1760010700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a choice: play it safe or gamble for <strong>two optional side challenges</strong>  to grab big multipliers. \u201cFood\u201d synergies bend the rules on the fly from careful tactics to explosive combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical <strong>5\u00d75</strong> board with chess-piece movement via cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>Kings</strong> with unique passives and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFood\u201d artifacts for <strong>combos, multipliers, and flexible builds</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two risk-reward challenges</strong> each round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15\u201325 minute</strong> runs: easy to pick up, deep to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean minimalist UI and straightforward controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, dangerously replayable. Wishlist now and see how far your King can go.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371170?t=1760010700","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371170?t=1760010700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371170/428311f028e819ad446ddfa2a6ba3f1b9064603d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760010700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371170/428311f028e819ad446ddfa2a6ba3f1b9064603d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760010700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"